#: portfolio/templates/portfolio/index.html:184
msgid ""
"I'm a Python Backend Developer based in Karshi, Uzbekistan, with over 2 "
"years of experience building robust, scalable web applications. My focus is "
"clean architecture, performance, and developer experience."
msgstr ""
"Men Qarshi, O'zbekistondan bo'lgan Python Backend dasturchisiman, ishonchli "
"va masshtablanuvchi veb-ilovalar yaratishda 2 yildan ortiq tajribaga "
"egaman. Mening e'tiborim toza arxitektura, unumdorlik va dasturchi "
"tajribasiga qaratilgan."

#: portfolio/templates/portfolio/index.html:191
msgid ""
"I specialize in Django ecosystems, with expertise in database optimization, "
"containerization, and cloud deployments. I believe great backend work is "
"invisible — it just works."
msgstr ""
"Men Django ekotizimiga ixtisoslashganman, ma'lumotlar bazasini "
"optimallashtirish, konteynerlashtirish va bulutli joylashtirish bo'yicha "
"tajribaga egaman. Yaxshi backend ishi ko'zga tashlanmaydi, deb "
"hisoblayman — u shunchaki ishlayveradi."

